# Frontend environment for the Orthodox AI Assistant UI (Vite).
# Copy to `.env` for local overrides. `.env` is gitignored — never commit real secrets.

# Local dev needs NO backend URL: the Vite dev server proxies /api -> http://localhost:8000
# (see vite.config.ts). Set VITE_API_BASE only when the API lives on a different origin,
# e.g. a production build served without the dev proxy.
# VITE_API_BASE=

# --- Supabase (currently unused scaffolding) --------------------------------------------
# The Supabase client under src/integrations/supabase/ is present but not wired into any
# screen. Leave blank for local dev. These are publishable (client-side) keys when set.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
